### Register new user (creates new employee automatically)
POST http://localhost:5091/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Mohammed",
  "email": "3tra@example.com",
  "password": "S@jed123",
  "employeeName": "Mohammed Ahmed",
  "position": "Pharmacist",
  "phoneNumber": "01234567890",
  "salary": 8000
}

### Register another user
POST http://localhost:5091/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sara.user",
  "email": "sara@pharmacy.com",
  "password": "Sara@123",
  "employeeName": "Sara Hassan",
  "position": "Pharmacy Assistant",
  "phoneNumber": "01098765432",
  "salary": 5500
}

### Get all employees to see available IDs
GET http://localhost:5091/api/Employees
